sentences.text:
7. Let the applicant Sangam Verma be released on bail in Case Crime No. 257 of 2022, under Sections 34, 420, 467, 468, 471 IPC, Police Station Masauli, District Barabanki on furnishing a bail bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned,
subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not temper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
.

